          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Violation rate: share of days with a loss beyond the VaR (promised: 1%). Passing the Kupiec test: share of the 59 companies and indices whose number of violations is consistent with 1%. Average VaR: size of the limit, in % of the position. Quantile loss: overall quality, lower is better (1 bp = 0.01%). Significance: Diebold-Mariano test against HAR-X (*** p < 1%, ** p < 5%, * p < 10%).'"
